+ ### 1.2 Air Defense Zone Classification
+ | Zone | Altitude | Threat Priority | Response |
+ |------|----------|----------------|---------|
+ | Low altitude | 0-300m | Immediate | Point defense priority |
+ | Medium altitude | 300-1500m | High | Area defense |
